# Keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets/artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.expo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets & local env — NEVER ship into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local infra data / scripts (portable-binary dev infra)
scripts/dev-infra
*.log

# VCS / editor / CI
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Docs & tests are not needed in the runtime image
**/*.md
